peof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/38px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/50px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nansi Gretta's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\">Nansi Gretta's</a> trading interface</li>\n<li>A row of books in <a href=\"/wiki/Elminster%27s_Library\" title=\"Elminster's Library\">Elminster's Library</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;9&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;102</span>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;4&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;100</span>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-6&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;110</span></li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/The_Blushing_Mermaid\" title=\"The Blushing Mermaid\">The Blushing Mermaid</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-110&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-87</span></li>\n<li>In Raphael's Boudior in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a></li>\n<li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Palace\" title=\"Szarr Palace\">Szarr Palace</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Palace#Chamberlain's_Suite\" title=\"Szarr Palace\">Chamberlain's Suite</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1255&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1001</span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[An excerpt from 'The Quarta Sune: A Guide to Sexuality, Eroticism, and Emotional Fulfilment. Detailed diagrams accompany every page.] \n</p><p><br>\nOn your journey to sensual alignment, treat each passionate encounter as a dance - your movements should flow from one to another, like a river through the mountains. For instance, it would likely be uncomfortable for you and your partner (or partners) to move immediately from the 'Bugbear Bend' into the 'Underdark Choke'. \n</p><p><br>\nInstead, after strenuous positions, gentler ones such as 'Threading the Weave', or 'Transitive Plane' are encouraged.\n</p><p><br>\nIt is also important to treat your partner's care post-encounter as the final step to this dance - recipes for scented oils for exhausted muscles, tea blends for sore throats, and massage tips can all be found in later chapters.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kama_Sutra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Kama Sutra\" src=\"/w/images/4/4e/Wikipedia_w.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kama_Sutra\">Kama Sutra</a></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195734\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1831/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33325/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11418/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935663/5242